pfQuest identifies its Vanilla dataset as powered by VMaNGOS and targeting
World of Warcraft Vanilla 1.12. This is an explicit Classic compatibility
fallback on Forever, not a claim that every old quest is unchanged on Forever.

Native Forever overrides: local deDE/enUS questcache.wdb records, captured
2026-10-03 from the _classic_beta_ client. Source build and SHA256 are retained
per record and in source-manifest.json. Native data takes precedence only in
the Forever buckets. Classic data remains separate and unchanged.

